Okay, what does a- mean? Christina

00:28:18.888 --> 00:28:19.745
[Christina] No,

00:28:19.745 --> 00:28:22.953
no, Vi- means "a lot"

00:28:22.953 --> 00:28:27.953
Pra- means "super", and the root √naś

00:28:28.230 --> 00:28:31.330
means "lost" or "disappeared"

00:28:31.330 --> 00:28:32.767
Understand?

00:28:32.767 --> 00:28:36.943
Very, absolutely not disappearing

00:28:38.291 --> 00:28:41.320
Absolutely not disappearing

00:28:41.320 --> 00:28:45.283
A-vi-pra-naasha, got it?

00:28:46.370 --> 00:28:48.670
Now you can say it in Sanskrit

