right?

00:31:05.560 --> 00:31:07.580
If you are reborn from the human realm to the human realm,

00:31:07.580 --> 00:31:12.140
you will experience some great suffering that celestial beings don't have.

00:31:12.140 --> 00:31:14.700
So if you go from the human realm to the celestial realm,

00:31:14.700 --> 00:31:19.676
