00:31:40.810 --> 00:31:43.930
So, it's very possible that when you go from the human realm

00:31:43.930 --> 00:31:47.858
to another realm,
something happens to your avipranashas.

00:31:47.858 --> 00:31:49.166


00:31:49.166 --> 00:31:50.858


00:31:50.858 --> 00:31:52.615


00:31:52.615 --> 00:31:55.010
But, are you ready?  I

00:31:55.010 --> 00:31:56.330
'm sorry,

