your karma may not follow you,

00:31:58.280 --> 00:32:01.221
but your avipranasha will.

00:32:01.221 --> 00:32:03.396
What does that mean?

00:32:06.675 --> 00:32:08.058
Your karma may not follow you,

00:32:08.058 --> 00:32:09.680
but your karma, what we call it...

00:32:09.680 --> 00:32:14.020
your "non-disappearance" will follow you, how about that?

00:32:14.020 --> 00:32:18.380
These are all Abhidharma.  Okay, sorry.

