00:32:26.287 --> 00:32:27.120
[Everyone laughs]

00:32:27.120 --> 00:32:29.630
I'm just telling you the

00:32:29.630 --> 00:32:30.670
next sentence.

00:32:30.670 --> 00:32:32.271
Sorry, the next sentence

00:32:32.271 --> 00:32:36.030
, MTHONG BA'I CHOS LA RNAM GNYIS PO,

00:32:36.030 --> 00:32:39.520
MTHONG BA'I CHOS refers to what

00:32:39.520 --> 00:32:42.240
you see on the path of seeing,

00:32:42.240 --> 00:32:44.573
but it can also mean dirsta-adirsta.

00:32:45.960 --> 00:32:49.800
Seeing in this life or seeing in a future life. That's what it

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:51.260
means.

00:32:51.260 --> 00:32:54.453
Will you see it? That

00:32:55.790 --> 00:32:57.030
is, dirsta-adirsta.

00:32:57.030 --> 00:33:02.030
When you do any kind of... how should we say it? At

00:33:02.580 --> 00:33:05.480
any time in this life,

00:33:05.480 --> 00:33:10.480
your "non-disappearance" in this life is dirsta.

00:33:10.670 --> 00:33:12.630
You will get it in this life,

00:33:12.630 --> 00:33:15.110
no matter what karma you create in this life.

00:33:15.110 --> 00:33:18.376
You will get something "non-disappearance" for it in this life.

00:33:18.376 --> 00:33:20.326
Dirsta refers to what you see in this life.

00:33:21.262 --> 00:33:22.750
RNAM GNYIS PO.

00:33:22.750 --> 00:33:25.411
In the Abhidharma system, this

00:33:25.411 --> 00:33:26.620
also applies to ZAG BCAS or ZAG MED.

