00:34:14.380 --> 00:34:18.490
you will still get a "non-disappearing" karma.

00:34:18.490 --> 00:34:21.720
Whether it's mental karma, that is, "thought" karma, that

00:34:21.720 --> 00:34:25.450
is, motivation, or actions or words driven by motivation,

00:34:25.450 --> 00:34:27.640


00:34:28.540 --> 00:34:30.790
you will still get a "non-disappearing" karma.

00:34:30.790 --> 00:34:34.091
That's all the details of "non-disappearing" karma.

00:34:35.544 --> 00:34:37.877
Avipranasha

00:34:39.299 --> 00:34:41.200
, THA DAD PAR NI SKYE 'GYUR ZHING,

00:34:41.200 --> 00:34:42.480
This is cool.

00:34:42.480 --> 00:34:46.880
Every time you create karma,
you get a separate "non-disappearing" karma.

00:34:46.880 --> 00:34:51.413
So basically you accumulate "non-disappearing" karma your whole life. You

00:34:51.413 --> 00:34:55.260
 
carry "non-disappearing" karma in your pocket your whole life.

00:34:55.260 --> 00:34:58.650
Every little thing you do,
you get a new "non-disappearing" karma.

00:34:58.650 --> 00:35:00.060
It's silent.  The text

00:35:00.060 --> 00:35:03.250
here says THA DAD, THA DAD PAR SKYE.

00:35:03.250 --> 00:35:04.923
It quietly arises

00:35:05.907 --> 00:35:08.145
, RNAM PAR SMIN KYANG GNAS PA YIN.

00:35:08.145 --> 00:35:10.040
This is really controversial.

00:35:10.040 --> 00:35:14.637
After the karma matures, it "won't disappear" and follows you.

00:35:17.630 --> 00:35:19.469
So what will it do? [laughs]

00:35:19.469 --> 00:35:20.680
Don't ask me,

00:35:20.680 --> 00:35:25.260
he didn't say, but according to Abhidharma,

00:35:25.260 --> 00:35:27.560
"not disappearing" will still follow you

00:35:27.560 --> 00:35:30.773
even if the karmic cause is destroyed, ripened,

00:35:31.640 --> 00:35:33.730
or ended.

00:35:33.730 --> 00:35:35.040
Even if the seed ends,

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:37.000
"not disappearing" will still follow you in some way.

00:35:37.000 --> 00:35:40.330
So we must be accumulating
millions of "not disappearing" things.

00:35:40.330 --> 00:35:44.300
If they no longer carry karma,
what will they do?  I don't know either.
