Here we begin to talk about
how to get rid of the "non-disappearing" karma. The

00:36:06.470 --> 00:36:07.770
extra "non-disappearing" karma.

00:36:07.770 --> 00:36:08.676
Okay

00:36:08.676 --> 00:36:09.701
, DE NI 'BRAS BU 'PHO BA DANG,

00:36:09.701 --> 00:36:11.581
,SHI BAR GYUR NA 'GAG PAR 'GYUR,

00:36:11.581 --> 00:36:13.020
Here the second part is simple.

00:36:13.020 --> 00:36:14.300
If you SHI BA,

00:36:14.300 --> 00:36:16.210
you lose all the "non-disappearing" karma.

00:36:16.210 --> 00:36:17.068
[Student] If you die,

00:36:17.068 --> 00:36:20.148
yes, if you die,
you lose part of the "non-disappearing" karma. It does

00:36:21.250 --> 00:36:22.880
n't seem to make sense

00:36:22.880 --> 00:36:25.634
because you should carry it into the next life.

00:36:25.634 --> 00:36:28.081
'BRAS BU 'PHO BA' means serious,

00:36:28.081 --> 00:36:33.081
