00:36:34.157 --> 00:36:38.740
This refers to a kind of Stream-entry.  The

00:36:38.740 --> 00:36:41.440
Sakadagami, Anagami, and Arhat fruits

00:36:41.440 --> 00:36:44.290
are collectively known as the four fruits of a Shramana.

00:36:44.290 --> 00:36:48.130
If it is a very large fruit, an extremely good deed, a

00:36:48.130 --> 00:36:52.880
significant spiritual realization,
"then, your 'non-disappearance' can be eliminated."

00:36:52.880 --> 00:36:54.990
I don't know.

