You will never go to a lower realm again,

00:37:06.590 --> 00:37:09.680
so they must have destroyed
your "non-disappearance."

00:37:09.680 --> 00:37:12.190
It must have destroyed part of your "non-disappearance."

00:37:12.190 --> 00:37:13.100
But then he said that it can only disappear

00:37:13.100 --> 00:37:17.111
when you become an Arhat.
I don't know.

00:37:17.111 --> 00:37:18.019
Okay

00:37:19.123 --> 00:37:21.223
, DE YI RNAM DBYE ZAG MED DANG,

00:37:21.223 --> 00:37:23.298
,ZAG DANG BCAS PAR SHES PAR BYA,

00:37:23.298 --> 00:37:26.520
You can have the "non-disappearance" of attaining enlightenment,

00:37:26.520 --> 00:37:30.813
or you can have the "non-disappearance" of continuous samsara.

