00:37:37.780 --> 00:37:41.255
Patch, I like this picture.

00:37:43.090 --> 00:37:44.710
I built a house for my guru. It cost

00:37:44.710 --> 00:37:48.018
me... wait, there's another picture of him. Yes,

00:37:49.240 --> 00:37:52.900
I built a house for my guru.

00:37:52.900 --> 00:37:56.330
I paid for it, I built it myself,

00:37:56.330 --> 00:38:01.330
and no one helped me.

00:38:01.490 --> 00:38:03.660
Maybe one day someone would come and lend a hand.

00:38:03.660 --> 00:38:05.460
I was standing so high up...

00:38:05.460 --> 00:38:08.010
It was two stories high, and I was on the third floor,

00:38:08.010 --> 00:38:10.600
on a ladder. I'll never forget it.

00:38:10.600 --> 00:38:12.740
It was winter, the dead of winter.

00:38:12.740 --> 00:38:16.653
I was on the ladder, painting the house like this. Then

00:38:17.562 --> 00:38:19.700
some people would come over,

00:38:19.700 --> 00:38:22.783
some old Mongolian men, and
they would say, "Hey, Mike."

00:38:22.783 --> 00:38:23.849
I said, "What's wrong?"

00:38:23.849 --> 00:38:26.350
He said, "I have to go to the store."

00:38:26.350 --> 00:38:30.130
I said, "I'm painting the house, and
nobody's helping me."

00:38:30.130 --> 00:38:33.020
Then he said, "But I need to go to the store, and I
need you to give me a ride."

00:38:33.020 --> 00:38:36.320
I am SPYI PA'I RTA.

00:38:36.320 --> 00:38:40.640
I am the community's public carriage.

00:38:40.640 --> 00:38:42.400
Why am I telling this story?

00:38:42.400 --> 00:38:45.350
If you get to a high enough place and
you leave your toolbox down below,

00:38:45.350 --> 00:38:47.160
if you work on the third floor,

00:38:47.160 --> 00:38:49.260
you'll often forget some tools.

00:38:49.260 --> 00:38:51.780
You'll have to climb up and down this dangerous ladder, go


00:38:51.780 --> 00:38:55.448
down two floors, grab a screwdriver, and then go back up.

00:38:55.448 --> 00:38:58.340
Then you forget the paint,

00:38:58.340 --> 00:38:59.710
and you're all alone. What

00:38:59.710 --> 00:39:02.190
I'm trying to say is that
if you get to a high enough place,

00:39:02.190 --> 00:39:06.680
you can put some of your "non-disappearing" ideas behind you.

00:39:06.680 --> 00:39:09.740
I don't know why this picture is used.

00:39:09.740 --> 00:39:10.573
Okay,

