00:39:51.435 --> 00:39:53.294
STONG PA NYID DANG TSAD MED DANG,

00:39:53.294 --> 00:39:56.593
,'KHOR BA DANG NI RTAG PA MIN,

00:39:56.593 --> 00:39:58.701
,LAS RNAMS CHUD MI ZA BA'I CHOS,

